X86_64 STOS+internal
"Hand-written loose corner (string store): the byte stores of one rep stosb observed in reverse order. Not covered by x86-TSO; XL verdict only."
{ int x=0; 0:rax=1; 0:rcx=2; 0:rdi=x; }
 P0            | P1              ;
 rep stosb     | movb (x+1),%al  ;
               | movb (x),%bl    ;
exists (1:rax=1 /\ 1:rbx=0)
